and/middleware&#39;;&#10;&#10;const mmkvStorage: StateStorage = {&#10;  getItem: (name) =&gt; storage.getString(name) ?? null,&#10;  setItem: (name, value) =&gt; storage.set(name, value),&#10;  removeItem: (name) =&gt; storage.delete(name),&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { MMKV } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-native-mmkv'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> storage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MMKV</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 同步读写——不需要 await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">storage.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user-token'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abc123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> token</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storage.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user-token'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 立即返回，无异步</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 与 Zustand 集成——替换 AsyncStorage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { StateStorage } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'zustand/middleware'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mmkvStorage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StateStorage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storage.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  setItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storage.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name, value),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  removeItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storage.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MMKV 的同步 API 特别适合应用启动时读取必要配置（主题、语言设置、访问令牌）——这些数据需要在首屏渲染前就可用，异步 AsyncStorage 会导致闪烁。</p>\n<p>关于如何在测试中 mock 状态和数据层，参见 <a href=\"../production-engineering/testing-quality\">测试与质量保障</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>React Native 状态管理的核心原则是<strong>按状态类型选择专用工具</strong>，而不是用一个万能方案管理所有数据。TanStack Query 专注于服务器状态的缓存、同步和乐观更新，消除了手动管理 loading/error/data 三元组的样板代码。Zustand 以极小的包体积提供了够用且灵活的客户端全局状态管理。局部 UI 状态应坚持用 <code>useState</code> / <code>useReducer</code> 处理，不要无谓提升到全局。</p>\n<p>持久化层面，MMKV 的同步 API 和 C++ 性能使它成为 AsyncStorage 的优选替代，尤其是对启动时间敏感的数据。乐观更新是提升用户体验的高杠杆手段，TanStack Query 的 <code>onMutate</code> / <code>onError</code> 回调让它的实现变得系统化而非特例化。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"React Native 状态与数据管理","id":"react-native-状态与数据管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三类状态的工具选型","id":"三类状态的工具选型"},{"level":2,"text":"TanStack Query：服务器状态管理","id":"tanstack-query-服务器状态管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Zustand：轻量级全局状态","id":"zustand-轻量级全局状态"},{"level":2,"text":"MMKV：高性能本地持久化","id":"mmkv-高性能本地持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"React Navigation：导航与路由体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/react-native-development/core-development/navigation-routing"},"next":{"title":"React Native 原生模块开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/react-native-development/native-integration/native-modules"}}